%% Phase4 / read / G-13 当前 viewer 会话已读
%% Helix owners: outbound/channel_admin/read.rs; port_reply/dispatch_read.rs; event/read.rs
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  UI->>Gate: query dialog list/current channels
  Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_query_dialog_list", query payload)
  Native->>E: Tick::Command(dialog query)
  E->>IM: local-first dialog list
  IM->>Host: Persist Scan channel/member rows
  Host->>DB: read current viewer unread/mention values
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(dialog absolute rows)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:read:result(req_id=dialog)
  Sink-->>UI: render current dialog list

  alt PC marks channels viewed
    UI->>Gate: channelsView(channelIds)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_channels_view", {channelIds})
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Mobile FFI marks viewed
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_channels_view", {channelIds})
  else Web marks viewed
    Web->>E: invoke("im_channels_view", {channelIds})
  end
  E->>IM: step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: dedupe channelIds and scope to current viewer
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST channels/view
  Host->>Go: channel read admission
  Go-->>Host: 2xx admission
  Go-->>WS: WS update_channel(read/unread/mention,event_seq)
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(update_channel)
  E->>IM: dispatch channel read authority
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(channel_member unread/mention + cursor)
  Host->>DB: commit only current viewer member rows
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet channel_member/channel
  Host->>DB: readback viewer-local zeroed projection
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:read:channel(read result)
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:channel:update(unreadCount,mentionCount)
  Sink-->>UI: clear current viewer badges; keep other viewers unchanged
  Sink-->>FFI: batch raw read/channel bytes
  Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw read/channel bytes
  alt HTTP/PersistErr or stale event_seq
    IM->>IM: retain previous durable projection; no false zero event
  end
  Note over UI,Web: session read is viewer-local；Angular 不从 sender/observer 数值反推未读，也不消费旧 Frame/surface directive。
